      "termCode": "StatisticalOutputCheck",
      "name": "Statistical output check",
      "description": "An assessment of one or more statistical outputs, such as tables, figures or summary statistics, for disclosure risk before release from a TRE, performed by a person, by software, or by both. Used as an additionalType value of an AssessAction.",
